# SPA fallback for per-gene records.
#
# Gene records are addressed at /{SYMBOL}/, but the static export ships ONE
# shell (out/gene/index.html) rather than one file per gene (5k+ files would
# blow Cloudflare Pages' 20k-file cap — see app/gene/page.tsx). Serve that
# shell with a 200 (URL preserved) for any path without a matching static
# asset, so /{SYMBOL}/ returns HTTP 200 and renders the record client-side
# instead of soft-404ing (rendering fine but returning 404 to crawlers and
# uptime monitors).
#
# Cloudflare Pages serves an existing static asset before evaluating this
# splat, so real routes (/, /api/, /reproducibility/, /data/*, ...) are
# unaffected; only asset-less paths fall through here.
/*    /gene/index.html    200
